    "qualifications": "Executive Assistant to Patrick Tobler (Founder & CEO of NMKR), actively engaged in the Cardano ecosystem since 2020. This role has given me deep exposure to the operational, technical, and strategic aspects of building in the Cardano space.\n\nInvestment & Development Insight: I possess a strong understanding of investment fundamentals and blockchain development, enabling me to assess proposals through both technical and economic lenses.\n\nPragmatic Evaluator: I only vote on proposals where I have sufficient expertise, ensuring responsible and informed governance decisions.",
